flowchart TB
  User[架构师 / AI Agent] --> M[MCP Adapter / CLI]
  M --> Inspect[Inspector & Evidence]
  M --> Core[Application Services & Model Core]
  Inspect --> Core
  Core --> Registry[Component Registry + Lock]
  Core --> Compiler[Architecture Compiler]
  Registry --> Compiler
  Core --> Dynamic[4D State/Event Engine]
  Dynamic --> Causal[5D Causality Engine]
  Causal --> Compiler
  Compiler --> QA[Validator & QA Gate]
  QA --> Export[HTML / JSON / MD / ZIP]
  Export --> Viewer[Independent 1D–5D Viewer & Prototype]
